   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 22412123,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ABW-001 Wall violation attempt (High)\nABW-002 Restricted order (High)\nABW-003 Legacy, no identity (Medium)\nABW-004 Client not allowed (High)\nABW-005 Revoked principal (High)\nABW-006 Repeated denials (Medium)\nABW-007 Entitlement drift (High)\nABW-008 Guardrail intervention (High)\nABW-009 Throttled burst (Low)\n\nThey read AbwMcpAudit (001-003),\nAbwGateway (004, 005, 009) and\nAbwDenials (006-008). Alerts and\nincidents return to the workspace as\nSecurityAlert and SecurityIncident.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "ABW-001 Wall violation attempt (High)\nABW-002 Restricted order (High)\nABW-003 Legacy, no identity (Medium)\nABW-004 Client not allowed (High)\nABW-005 Revoked principal (High)\nABW-006 Repeated denials (Medium)\nABW-007 Entitlement drift (High)\nABW-008 Guardrail intervention (High)\nABW-009 Throttled burst (Low)\n\nThey read AbwMcpAudit (001-003),\nAbwGateway (004, 005, 009) and\nAbwDenials (006-008). Alerts and\nincidents return to the workspace as\nSecurityAlert and SecurityIncident.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
