   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Any one id finds the whole run: a tool-call request_id, a front-door request id or the trace id. The request_id echoed in the Foundry tool result\n  bridges the trace and the request ids.\n- Four exceptions break the exact join: the guardrail (trace id only), Entra (token id, in its own workspace), the private server (no APIM row) and\n  Search and Cosmos DB (matched by time).\n- Sentinel cannot see Entra sign-ins in this build, so a failed sign-in is read from Entra's own log. In production, switch the Entra ID connector on.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Any one id finds the whole run: a tool-call request_id, a front-door request id or the trace id. The request_id echoed in the Foundry tool result\n  bridges the trace and the request ids.\n- Four exceptions break the exact join: the guardrail (trace id only), Entra (token id, in its own workspace), the private server (no APIM row) and\n  Search and Cosmos DB (matched by time).\n- Sentinel cannot see Entra sign-ins in this build, so a failed sign-in is read from Entra's own log. In production, switch the Entra ID connector on.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
