   "text": "1. Each layer logs to its own table and carries the join key it has.\n2. Everything lands in one Log Analytics workspace, except Entra's sign-in logs, which stay in their own.\n3. KQL functions join the tables on those keys and expose one chain.\n4. The workbook, Sentinel, the ops alerts and the Demo Console read the functions.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Each layer logs to its own table and carries the join key it has.\n2. Everything lands in one Log Analytics workspace, except Entra's sign-in logs, which stay in their own.\n3. KQL functions join the tables on those keys and expose one chain.\n4. The workbook, Sentinel, the ops alerts and the Demo Console read the functions.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
